# Replace fontconfig + freetype2 with a compiled-in 8x8 bitmap font. Porting freetype2 to draw ASCII would have been a far larger change than the terminal it serves. The glyph data is the font Samsara's own user-space console already uses, so every Samsara program renders text identically. A codepoint with no glyph returns NULL, which is fbterm's own placeholder-box path, so unsupported text is visibly wrong rather than silently blank.
#
# Generated with `git diff` against the pinned fbterm commit
# 419c6be55413a7069fbcc66883d58caa94ba3933. Regenerate with
# ports/fbterm/build.sh; never edit by hand.

