+ * whichever translation unit defines the class's *key function* -- the first
+ * non-inline, non-pure virtual member function. With no destructor definition
+ * anywhere, there is no key function, no vtable is emitted, and the link fails
+ * with "undefined reference to vtable for Font" -- an error that names neither
+ * the missing destructor nor the header that declared it.
+ *
+ * So the destructor is defined here, where the rest of the class lives. There
